                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First impressions, it needs more work. Will try to put a positive spin on it because we have to support our indie devs. Very basic fps, killing spawned zombies in an arena, should work if playing with a few buds. Animation is like lego, a bit pixelated even on high graphics. Physics buggy. AI very basic, and you can play a level with one hand on the mouse, sipping coffee with the other. Will you have fun, yes, for a while. Will you play it again after the first run, probaly not. Felt like a bundle filler, not a full fledged game on its own. 4.5/10",
